@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 42
title HD — conditional handoff position
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Populated selected inputs\n03, 05–10 models/contracts; 12 interfaces; 13 scenarios\nSource hashes identify current working package" as Models
rectangle "Remaining analysis specificity\n04 functions/DFDs; exact criterion/path/policy reconciliation\n15 has no observed current-process study" as Remaining #4A302B
rectangle "Qualified design input package\nAccepted core + marked proposals + scoped gates" as Package #17405A
rectangle "Later actual coherent design/baseline review\nRequired decisions/evidence/conditions identified" as Review
Models --> Package : useful current input
Remaining --> Package : limits whole-phase completion
Package --> Review : no automatic acceptance
note bottom of Review
This file does not create final architecture or product code.
Incomplete whole-phase acceptance does not force a folder restart.
end note

legend bottom
Qualified analysis/design input, not a selected architecture, accepted forecast or operational proof.
No coding, provider/host operation, live tracker update, spending or baseline acceptance performed.
endlegend
@enduml
